\pard\b\fs20 The World ends with You\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Clonks' industry has weakened the planet so much that it is on the verge of destruction. Sky islands are falling, the ground is breaking apart, lava is coming out of the core and islands are sinking. Some Clonks have hidden in the ground, others hope to be able to live on the sky islands. But a researcher who foresaw the end has developed a rocket to survive in space. It won't be that easy, though. Metal and wood are sold out, and the only way to get the materials you need is to mine everything from the ground.\par
\par
The goal is to build a rocket. Sky islands keep falling down, and other natural disasters strike.\par
\par
Tip:\par
\par
Even though much is destroyed, you should look for the working settlement to save yourself a lot of work.\par
\par
Don't be careless with the building materials, you can't buy any!\par
